<title>Ecuador's security crisis: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ecuador/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ecuador-2026-10-22T18:41:31.651Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:41:31 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Father Patricio Alfredo Sánchez Molinari was killed when a wall-mounted crucifix fell on him during a livestreamed Mass in Guayaquil, and the church reinstalled the same cross two days later, prompting his family to demand an inquiry and allege he had stolen $2 million from worshippers. The incident occurs amid Ecuador's security crisis that began in 2018 due to conflicts between criminal organizations linked to drug trafficking. The crisis recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP. Critics describe the episode as a leadership failure within the Ecuadorian Catholic hierarchy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxON0diRWtYOVBGX2ZQZVlER3ZTWkZjYmtYSFAydUs2eFQ1NzM2NWZNRFlSci13Slg1V1VPa1N1YTBUWGZWZG5IbDJkUzgzX3hONm9jUTh2Z1paUWNGOHBzUGhrcXE4UjNOblp4WDlVcVJZLWFqajVLT212WTBNM1F1VHRQSGdGQzhqNUVJbkw0c1Nkc0Vl?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQODBMY056RXdBUUhkeEpSUWZnN1Y4T2lTV3U0RnREeUVSV2taNzVwbjFjbFBYeFBNLXpsRGZlVUhzWHRzS3hyN1dkcnZWZHU5bHE4elJWNXhDV1ZEdmpXdDVRU2NfRnB5QXhZb3hkcmZrU3RqZFRYQ2s5al9XWVYzU1Rma1hCOTVyUHFMRzI2YTdqVGxFTmc4Zy1Zc2tHQzZTZWdzb2VFakhzakE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Beliefnet&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTFBRNmJiMW5UUHo5ejV6QlQ0WE5yUkpFVmtxSFRaNjZ2Wno4U1NiUGtoT29QWUpoUjdkSVZBc3E5MkEtZklWcVV3bmpuckk0NFRXWDVxVjFxODBrenVOYkFMdGxaZjZvN0w4bkdxRHhvemVVc1JKWEViMVNtQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;GIS Reports&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPdFAyemNHZ1hmMWNzZm1DUEc3c1lDdFBZbFRVTXdvNTJvbzQ2Z3F4dXc1ek1xMnNMYlhDa0VOeWxQV3FDekJtWDlVLUItX01wSl9MVTNHRFJCdUpxSHdYY2VKazBVMzk0ZXlhUkg1eGc2Ulg3cmhQOVJwMkVYQ1dSV3lxQjNNQUdadWNjMWxINzVNN2pTRzJNUmkwX1h3dw?oc=5&quot;&g